# The wasm plug refuses the 256-bit families by emitting a token wat2wasm rejects:
# the WAT must carry (codex-refused-<name>-256-bit-vector-on-wasm) for each line
# below and the module must fail to assemble. vec8-splat and the comparison sit
# inside expressions refused whole, so this subject cannot reach their tokens.
vec4d-splat
vec8-extract
mask8-any
vec4d-reduce-add
vector-operator
